{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028060356565-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028061746\"/><p>長者經過該輛車時掏出剪刀劃痕。</p><p>江蘇一名長者日前在路上行走期間，突然掏出剪刀劃向路邊停放的車輛。車主當時正坐在車內，全程目睹並以行車紀錄儀完整拍下事發經過，見長者作案後打算離開，車主當場攔下並報警。</p><p>車主事後表示，事發時自己就在車內，對長者突如其來的舉動感到錯愕。經協調，長者的子女已同意承擔車輛全部維修費用。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:38.035384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:03:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.277223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T22:18:23.009344+00:00","content_hash":"933f829f81e9542d2ab2d5a200fd1352b43ad7e0f42a069097fa685ab5d2e786","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:38.035384+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}